            "review_title": "Review at Vuon Phap Coffee & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Huong L\n1 contribution\n0\nNice place, good service as a Home stay/ hostel\nFeb 2020\nWe were a family of 4, rented 2 violet rooms. Good price. Near Dak Lak Museum. (Address on google map was located not correctly so abit hard to find at first for driver from Phu Yen, but for taxi driver is ok). Nice & large rooms with different color theme and many lights made from bamboo/rattan. There is a garden infront of the rooms. Quited and security. Few steps to their coffee garden and swimming pool (I guess swimming pool is chargeable). Breakfast is included with Noodle or murphin, just so so. Staff are very nice and friendly & cute, help us to get a taxi driver for the whole day visit with good price and nice attitude. They gave us a set of nice herbal tea which was very warm for a windy night. Highly recommend. \n\n(-) info on internet is abit confused. As it's a homestay, also a cafe & restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 14, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
